  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the UNFCCC for Developing Countries&#x2019; Participation at the Copenhagen Climate Ministerial meeting in Copenhagen 21- 22 March 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation is to ensure up to 22 OECD-DAC-listed developing countries&#x2019; participation in the Copenhagen Climate Ministerial as well as the participation of the COP Presidency (AZ), UNFCCC Executive Secretary (Grenada) and SBI chair (Pakistan).</narrative>
